# Cloudflare Pages edge redirects.
# Copied verbatim into apps/docs/out/ by Next.js's static-export step.
#
# The docs app routes everything under [lang]/, so on-disk layout is
# /en/<page>/index.html. fumadocs's hideLocale: "default-locale" makes
# the sidebar emit prefix-free URLs (`/agents/`, `/assigning-issues/`)
# which don't exist on disk. Without these rules they 404.
#
# We use 302 redirects (URL bar shifts to /en/<page>/) rather than
# rewrites because CF Pages does NOT support splats in rewrites — and a
# splat + status-200 rule actively breaks routing for unrelated paths
# (verified — see deploy fcbe3fd7 where every /en/* page returned 404
# until we removed the rule). Enumerating each route avoids that
# entire class of bug.

/    /en/    302
/agents    /en/agents/    302
/agents/*    /en/agents/:splat    302
/agents-create    /en/agents-create/    302
/agents-create/*    /en/agents-create/:splat    302
/assigning-issues    /en/assigning-issues/    302
/assigning-issues/*    /en/assigning-issues/:splat    302
